<p>You add a portable furnace to your steam generators.</p><p>While it is active your fire and physical damage increases by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2%, 5%, 6%, 8%, 10%</acronym> and your fire and physical resistance penetration by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1%, 10%, 15%, 19%, 21%.</acronym></p><p><span style="font-style: italic"><span class="tstr-font-italic">Burninate all with awesome Steam power!</span></span></p><p></p>